+Showing the Configuration
+-------------------------
+
+The ``flask config`` command prints the application's configuration as
+sorted JSON. Secret-looking values are masked as ``***``.
+
+.. code-block:: text
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      ...
+    }
+
+
